{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is currently a trial version, where players will operate to devour enemy genes and evolve into a variant of the enemy form, participating in the terrifying experiment of aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The content includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. There are 13 variants that can evolve freely and adapt to different environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736060/extras/11.png?t=1748403158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. There are 41 variant characteristics that can be freely combined to create a unique king of exotic beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736060/extras/\u56fe\u724712.png?t=1748403158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. There are three special experimental events and one large-scale weather experiment, and players need to evolve and survive under different conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736060/extras/5.png?t=1748403158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Unique sacrifice mechanism, players need to collect the genetic sequences of variants and sacrifice them to the Red Moon Pool to obtain powerful characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736060/extras/10.png?t=1748403158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5. The grand experimental site is distributed with hormones with different functions in different areas, which can effectively avoid danger and kill variants with the help of hormones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736060/extras/4.png?t=1748403158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full version game introduction:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill enemies to evolve into enemy form. Players will control mutated creatures with this ability, constantly fighting against other mutated creatures to evolve into more powerful creatures. They will survive in terrifying alien experiments and become the king of beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evolutionary freedom, as long as you kill enemies, you can evolve into enemy form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perilous dangers lurk in the alien experimental field, and players need to remain vigilant at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive experience, a grand and unique alien experimental field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736060/extras/Shop1.png?t=1748403158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse in characteristics, mutated creatures possess unique abilities to extract and combine different traits to create a one-of-a-kind king of exotic beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fighting wits and courage, directly challenging powerful mutant creatures is not the best way. It requires the reasonable use of experimental field mechanisms and other mutant creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time limited survival, as time goes by, more and more powerful experimental subjects will join the battle and survive until the end to become the king of beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736060?t=1748403158","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736060/e6cc454ba798c9276963ba07adde3eb4ff0ae65b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748403158","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736060/fe0d95938d01f2d4d093eb52695b53be60396cf8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748403158","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736060/fe0d95938d01f2d4d093eb52695b53be60396cf8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748403158","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is currently a trial version, where players will operate to devour enemy genes and evolve into a variant of the enemy form, participating in the terrifying experiment of aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The content includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. There are 13 variants that can evolve freely and adapt to different environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736060/extras/11.png?t=1748403158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. There are 41 variant characteristics that can be freely combined to create a unique king of exotic beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736060/extras/\u56fe\u724712.png?t=1748403158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. There are three special experimental events and one large-scale weather experiment, and players need to evolve and survive under different conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736060/extras/5.png?t=1748403158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Unique sacrifice mechanism, players need to collect the genetic sequences of variants and sacrifice them to the Red Moon Pool to obtain powerful characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736060/extras/10.png?t=1748403158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5. The grand experimental site is distributed with hormones with different functions in different areas, which can effectively avoid danger and kill variants with the help of hormones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736060/extras/4.png?t=1748403158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full version game introduction:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill enemies to evolve into enemy form. Players will control mutated creatures with this ability, constantly fighting against other mutated creatures to evolve into more powerful creatures. They will survive in terrifying alien experiments and become the king of beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evolutionary freedom, as long as you kill enemies, you can evolve into enemy form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perilous dangers lurk in the alien experimental field, and players need to remain vigilant at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive experience, a grand and unique alien experimental field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736060/extras/Shop1.png?t=1748403158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse in characteristics, mutated creatures possess unique abilities to extract and combine different traits to create a one-of-a-kind king of exotic beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fighting wits and courage, directly challenging powerful mutant creatures is not the best way. It requires the reasonable use of experimental field mechanisms and other mutant creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time limited survival, as time goes by, more and more powerful experimental subjects will join the battle and survive until the end to become the king of beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["upmupm420"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3284860","name":"The King Of Beasts"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736060/523225c96e0b9093aca49d91de0057244c2aeb9d/header.jpg?t=1748403158","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257145144,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145144/movie480.mp4?t=1748313559","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145144/movie_max.mp4?t=1748313559"},"name":"TKOBPlay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257145144/c3a8d2c4687e454243f1245c6d52e6b4abb0ce88/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748313559","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145144/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748313559","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145144/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748313559"}}],"name":"\u5f02\u517d\u4e4b\u738b The King Of Beasts Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> win10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<